  "interpretation": "The dated local photo walk explicitly distinguishes the wide single dormer and pebble-washed hipped roof of restaurant No.3 from No.1 with two-level open verandas and gabled timber framing. The Huashan Road restaurant pin falls inside native 1561. The restaurant company has a separate legal business pin nearby. The OSM label for 1353 has one unsourced 2017 version. No surviving primary site plan was located in this check.",
